  m_text: '<color=#C4A06A><size=21>CREATED BY</size></color>

    <size=38>Alejandro Cruz-Garcia</size>

    Game Design, Programming & Original Artwork



    <color=#C4A06A><size=21>MUSIC</size></color>

    <size=32>FazeDevWater</size>

    Dungeon Themes

    <link="https://opengameart.org/content/dungeon-themes"><size=21><color=#C4A06A>View source</color></size></link>


    <size=32>MintoDog</size>

    Great Labyrinth

    <link="https://opengameart.org/node/155823"><size=21><color=#C4A06A>View source</color></size></link>


    <size=32>northivanastan</size>

    Death Waltz

    <link="https://opengameart.org/content/death-waltz"><size=21><color=#C4A06A>View source</color></size></link>


    <size=32>RandomMind</size>

    Medieval: Victory Theme

    Medieval: Defeat Theme


    <size=21>Music sourced from OpenGameArt.org

    Listed music released under CC0</size>



    <color=#C4A06A><size=21>SOUND EFFECTS</size></color>

    <size=32>Kenney</size>

    Casino Audio / Impact Sounds / RPG Audio

    <link="https://kenney.nl/assets/casino-audio"><size=21><color=#C4A06A>Casino Audio</color></size></link>   /   <link="https://kenney.nl/assets/impact-sounds"><size=21><color=#C4A06A>Impact Sounds</color></size></link>   /   <link="https://kenney.nl/assets/rpg-audio"><size=21><color=#C4A06A>RPG Audio</color></size></link>


    <size=32>StarNinjas</size>

    20 Sword Sound Effects - Attacks and Clashes

    <link="https://opengameart.org/content/20-sword-sound-effects-attacks-and-clashes"><size=21><color=#C4A06A>View source</color></size></link>


    Additional sound editing

    Alejandro Cruz-Garcia



    <color=#C4A06A><size=21>ADDITIONAL ASSETS</size></color>

    <size=32>JenniferBertaggia</size>

    Modern RPG - Free Icons Pack


    <size=32>Kat Grabowska</size>

    300+ RPG Flat Icons Pack


    <size=32>Digital Ruby / Jeff Johnson</size>

    Rain Maker


    <size=32>Game Seed Assets</size>

    Fog Particles



    <color=#C4A06A><size=21>FONTS</size></color>

    Ibarra Real Nova

    The Ibarra Real Nova Project Authors


    Jost

    The Jost Project Authors


    Liberation Sans

    See the font''s accompanying license notice



    <color=#C4A06A><size=21>SPECIAL THANKS</size></color>

    To everyone who playtested Cursed Knight

    and shared their feedback.



    <size=36>Thank you for playing.</size>

'
